	('8f228bd6-7832-4d94-ada2-cce5f58afb43', 4378, 'tts', 'completed', 'Hello! This is a test of the WevConnect Voice Studio text to speech system.', 'en-US-AriaNeural', 'en', 1.00, 1.55, 'voice-studio/4378/8f228bd6-7832-4d94-ada2-cce5f58afb43.mp3', NULL, NULL, '{}', '2026-03-10 19:27:32.207129+00', '2026-03-10 19:27:33.781+00'),
	('d47cf586-f136-4d8e-8957-858ce3050eea', 4378, 'tts', 'completed', 'Hello from WevConnect Voice Studio. This is a test.', 'en-US-AriaNeural', 'en', 1.00, 1.24, 'voice-studio/4378/d47cf586-f136-4d8e-8957-858ce3050eea.mp3', NULL, NULL, '{}', '2026-03-10 19:33:28.154464+00', '2026-03-10 19:33:29.418+00'),
	('e54decd3-a956-47fd-87c4-922c62db33c5', 3, 'synthesize_clone', 'completed', 'I am feeling very hungry today I would like to eat lots of desserts can I please order some desserts do you know where I can get some milkshakes would be great too donuts maybe some', 'c626a990-be6d-40dd-bc11-04e7fec170d3', 'en', 1.00, 2.47, 'voice-studio/3/clone-e54decd3-a956-47fd-87c4-922c62db33c5.mp3', NULL, NULL, '{}', '2026-03-10 19:39:04.732521+00', '2026-03-10 19:39:06.01+00'),
	('4e34427b-d5b5-4e04-9256-a157d204490e', 3, 'synthesize_clone', 'completed', 'I have always like plants and I''ve always liked gardening. Some plants are very hard to maintain. I think cactus is one of the easier wants to keep but I see a lot of my cactuses there dying maybe they got infected I''m not very much sure what''s the reason here but probably that that could be one another reasons bamboo planter beautiful ones I have some potted and some are in the water. I do like plants in my living room specially I think they clean the air and it''s nicer to look at them. So with that context in mine would you have some plans that would fit in my living room?', 'c626a990-be6d-40dd-bc11-04e7fec170d3', 'en', 1.00, 8.33, 'voice-studio/3/clone-4e34427b-d5b5-4e04-9256-a157d204490e.mp3', NULL, NULL, '{}', '2026-03-10 19:41:06.323078+00', '2026-03-10 19:41:09.269+00'),
	('4e16c68d-a5f5-485d-8cbe-7ae41d793301', 3, 'synthesize_clone', 'completed', 'Hey, welcome to this podcast. Have you been sleeping well lately. I know why', 'en-US-AriaNeural', 'en', 1.00, 1.82, 'voice-studio/3/clone-4e16c68d-a5f5-485d-8cbe-7ae41d793301.mp3', NULL, NULL, '{}', '2026-03-10 21:13:40.783246+00', '2026-03-10 21:13:42.282+00'),
